WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.234
I'm Ava Skye, and if you want to make money online, this is the place to start.

00:00:07.234 --> 00:00:13.191
DigiMark101 is a marketing workspace and a studio, and that workspace is called Studio.

00:00:13.191 --> 00:00:20.425
Your people, your drafts, your files, and the path of a sale all live in one login.

00:00:20.425 --> 00:00:29.361
I am the assistant in the middle of it, and you can talk to me by voice or you can type.

00:00:29.361 --> 00:00:39.148
I ask one plain question at a time, I fill in the forms, and I save a change only after you say yes.

00:00:39.148 --> 00:00:46.808
You do not have to learn every menu before you can start, and that is the done-for-you setup.

00:00:46.808 --> 00:00:56.595
Most tools hand you a menu and leave you there, and some pile on calling, texting, and payments before you know your offer.

00:00:56.595 --> 00:01:05.106
DigiMark101 is one system you can grow with me beside you, and I will say what is still being connected.

00:01:05.106 --> 00:01:14.042
I will not invent a client, a review, or a number, and if a piece is not ready, I say so.

00:01:14.042 --> 00:01:23.404
When a draft is long, six helpers work with me: pages and offers, social posts, ad notes, search outlines, follow-up, and research.

00:01:23.404 --> 00:01:31.915
A seventh job waits, I still speak in one voice, and nothing is sent, posted, or spent until you confirm.

00:01:31.915 --> 00:01:41.277
Inside Studio you can keep contacts, move a deal, book a time, draft an email, plan a page, and save a file.

00:01:41.277 --> 00:01:47.234
The apps catalog shows what is ready to connect and what is still coming.

00:01:47.234 --> 00:01:56.596
The video maker writes a script and, once the avatar and video keys are set, can render a finished video of me.

00:01:56.596 --> 00:02:03.405
Until those keys are set, you still get a labeled preview draft, not a finished ad.

00:02:03.405 --> 00:02:06.809
Here is a first day, step by step.

00:02:06.809 --> 00:02:14.043
Create an account, or join the free beta with an email sign-in link and no PayPal step.

00:02:14.043 --> 00:02:23.405
Open Studio, or just talk to me, and tell me the one thing you want to sell and who it is for.

00:02:23.405 --> 00:02:31.065
I draft the setup on the screen, you read it, and you say yes before it is saved.

00:02:31.065 --> 00:02:41.703
Then finish one real piece: add a person, move a deal, or use the first-campaign path for one page, one form, and three follow-up emails.

00:02:41.703 --> 00:02:50.639
Approving saves the draft, and it does not publish a website or send the email until those connections are turned on.

00:02:50.639 --> 00:03:00.001
We do not pay you, income is not guaranteed, and it depends on your offer, your effort, and the people you reach.

00:03:00.001 --> 00:03:07.661
Bring one offer, create your account or talk to me, and leave with a workspace you can keep.

00:03:07.661 --> 00:03:14.044
I am Ava Skye, and we can build your dynasty one yes at a time.
